{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2021-05-20 09:00:00', 'title': 'RUBBERMAID® COMMERCIAL PRODUCTS (RCP) KICKS OFF BACK TO CLEAN WITH DONATION OF $1.3 MILLION IN HAND SANITIZER PRODUCT TO UNDER-RESOURCED SCHOOLS ACROSS THE NATION', 'text': "HUNTERSVILLE, N.C., MAY 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY,\xa0RUBBERMAID®COMMERCIAL PRODUCTS (RCP), PART OF NEWELL BRANDS' COMMERCIAL BUSINESS, ANNOUNCED THE DONATION OF $1.3 MILLION IN ITS HAND SANITIZER PRODUCT TO UNDER-RESOURCED SCHOOLS THROUGH A PARTNERSHIP WITH KIDS IN NEED FOUNDATION (KINF)."}